three servers listen: yes
get: 200 HTTP/2 GET /hello h2
post: 200 HTTP/2 POST /echo h2 over h2
events: status 200 HTTP/2, event stream: yes
  h2: one
  message: two
past the limit: 413 HTTP/2
after it: 200 HTTP/2 GET /after h2
a client with http2 off: 200 HTTP/1.1 GET /hello h1
a server not offering h2: 200 HTTP/1.1 GET /hello h1
a Conn offering h2: 200 HTTP/2 GET /conn h2
twenty at once through one client, each 200 over HTTP/2: 20
end
